stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SelectProfile: Start

    SelectProfile: Select Profile
    SelectProfile: Check locked profile or ordered list

    TryProfile: Try Profile
    TryProfile: Send request to provider

    ClassifyError: Classify Error
    ClassifyError: auth, billing, rate_limit, timeout, format

    ApplyCooldown: Apply Cooldown
    ApplyCooldown: Exponential backoff
    ApplyCooldown: 1min then 5min then 25min then max 1hr

    DisableProfile: Disable Profile
    DisableProfile: Long disable for billing errors
    DisableProfile: 5hr then 10hr then 20hr then max 24hr

    Success: Success
    Success: 200 OK response

    FailoverError: Failover Error
    FailoverError: All profiles exhausted

    SelectProfile --> TryProfile: Profile available
    SelectProfile --> FailoverError: All exhausted

    TryProfile --> Success: 200 OK
    TryProfile --> ClassifyError: Error response

    ClassifyError --> ApplyCooldown: Transient error
    ClassifyError --> DisableProfile: Billing error

    ApplyCooldown --> SelectProfile: Try next profile
    DisableProfile --> SelectProfile: Try next profile

    Success --> [*]
    FailoverError --> [*]
